                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4585f73-ef1b-394d-986e-cdc9266b37a3",
                                        "entry_id": "c4ada53c-8419-3507-b0ba-0d0232379461",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An activity or situation which is congested with participants and which is hectic or tedious, especially in the context of a busy, modern urban lifestyle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7a38c88-1e07-4642-8ad1-03c12d2d74ab",
                                                "sense_id": "f4585f73-ef1b-394d-986e-cdc9266b37a3",
                                                "text": "[…] a 1950s-ish town, keeping a sense of community far from the superhighway rat race."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f0b35a3a-db60-3b00-b0fa-b2d8d4431a44",
                                        "entry_id": "c4ada53c-8419-3507-b0ba-0d0232379461",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The busy, modern urban lifestyle itself, especially when seen as a competition for wealth or power."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4e6e91a-f6c3-41ec-8eff-347e2b67f934",
                                                "sense_id": "f0b35a3a-db60-3b00-b0fa-b2d8d4431a44",
                                                "text": "Forget about the rat race / Let's do the Milkshake / Selling like a hotcake"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47d119cc-f792-41e6-a1d8-7fb08ba83074",
                                                "sense_id": "f0b35a3a-db60-3b00-b0fa-b2d8d4431a44",
                                                "text": "I was running away […] from my inability, although I am quite an attractive rat, to make headway in the rat-race."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59bee13f-0f95-4dda-93d7-32aeba65f229",
                                                "sense_id": "f0b35a3a-db60-3b00-b0fa-b2d8d4431a44",
                                                "text": "Echoing Allen Ginsberg, he contends that the suburban setting of “Father Knows Best” is most accurately seen as America's “ludicrous breeding ground for the young meat who will be fed into its wars and rat races and inhuman conformities.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "753c8c65-ebf2-3111-b80d-f084ab54043d",
                                        "entry_id": "c4ada53c-8419-3507-b0ba-0d0232379461",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inconsiderate or unfair competition, where the competitors are willing to use any means to win."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "51fab7c8-93a1-47c5-a5d8-7a470896e4b5",
                        "source_entry_id": "7ac425e7-3c80-387c-9b8e-dd0bf8131a1d",
                        "source_sense_id": "e910d3e2-2e1f-320d-98aa-91d6866111f8",
                        "source_sense_description": "Wirtschaft: ein Wettbewerb, bei dem mehr Ressourcen aufgewendet werden, als gewonnen werden können",
                        "target_lang_word": "panier de crabes",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "panier de crabes",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2bb9c0b-b12e-3ad8-a452-8871f6e1a8d8",
                                        "entry_id": "67a87d12-c570-3090-b2b4-65d0e0e88762",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Groupe d’individus se comportant méchamment les uns vis-à-vis des autres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "collective"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a971dc6e-d9a8-4cb2-8512-b10b95b38aba",
                                                "sense_id": "f2bb9c0b-b12e-3ad8-a452-8871f6e1a8d8",
                                                "text": "Marat, envolé au Panthéon des grands hommes, a laissé après lui sur terre une Assemblée dont il avait fait un panier de crabes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cbc3d58-aa87-4a12-b83f-78fb77fb4175",
                                                "sense_id": "f2bb9c0b-b12e-3ad8-a452-8871f6e1a8d8",
                                                "text": "Personne n’avait prévu cette conséquence du Covid-19 : les pistes cyclables, longtemps désespérément désertes, sont devenues en quelques semaines des paniers de crabes. Si le « monde d’après » ressemble à ce qui s’y passe, mieux vaut regrimper illico dans une machine à remonter le temps. Le trajet sympa, le nez au vent, avec l’assurance d’arriver un peu moite mais à l’heure et la bonne conscience d’un peu de sport et d’un geste pour la planète, a laissé la place à une foire d’empoigne, entre coups de sonnette rageurs, mêlées aux carrefours et regards hautains des vieux routards sur les nouveaux convertis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
